{"id":"75d2b21be8a5db5d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-multiplicative-linear.md","title":"Multiplicative Linear Logic","display":"df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-multiplicative-linear","aliases":["72-df-multiplicative-linear"],"display":"df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic","depends_on":["[[72-df-linear-logic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, Appendix B §§B.2–B.4 print151–158; independent one-sided finite-multiset encoding","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"将片段规则的载体限制从文字约定写成实际关系交"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-multiplicative-linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-multiplicative-linear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, Appendix B §§B.2–B.4 print151–158; independent one-sided finite-multiset encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"将片段规则的载体限制从文字约定写成实际关系交"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-multiplicative-linear\">df-multiplicative-linear</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\)</span>；片段中的其余规则也只取全部判断属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k\">\\(U_k\\)</span> 的实例（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=M\">\\(k=M\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，按下式）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF^{M}_0&amp;:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf1,\\bot\\},\\\\\nF^{M}_{n+1}&amp;:=F^{M}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{M}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_M:=\\bigcup_nF^{M}_n,\\\\\nU_M&amp;:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_M\\},\\\\\nR_{id,M}&amp;:=R_{id}\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M),\\quad R_{cut,M}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF^{M}_0&amp;:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf1,\\bot\\},\\\\\nF^{M}_{n+1}&amp;:=F^{M}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{M}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_M:=\\bigcup_nF^{M}_n,\\\\\nU_M&amp;:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_M\\},\\\\\nR_{id,M}&amp;:=R_{id}\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M),\\quad R_{cut,M}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_M:=(R_{id,M}\\cup R_\\otimes\\cup R_{⅋}\\cup R_1\\cup R_\\bot\\cup R_{cut,M})\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M),\\qquad\\mathsf{MLL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_M,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_M}(R_M)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_M:=(R_{id,M}\\cup R_\\otimes\\cup R_{⅋}\\cup R_1\\cup R_\\bot\\cup R_{cut,M})\\cap(U_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_M),\\qquad\\mathsf{MLL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_M,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_M}(R_M)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则是有前提序列与结论的有序对集合，非一个没有定义的可导性谓词。片段语法由有限构造迭代给出；指数节点指完整命题LL中!/?规则层，不把一般结构规则加回非指数公式。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：原 Hypothesis 已要求所有规则实例限制到片段判断，现将该限制显式写为与 UM 的有限前提规则空间相交。Cl 的输入因此在公式本身即满足其类型条件；数学意图及既有片段保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-multiplicative-linear","text":"df-multiplicative-linear","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。 $\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)>0\\}$；片段中的其余规则也只取全部判断属于 $U_k$ 的实例（$k=M$ 或 $A$，按下式）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)>0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_k","display":false},{"tex":"k=M","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF^{M}_0&:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf1,\\bot\\},\\\\\nF^{M}_{n+1}&:=F^{M}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{M}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_M:=\\bigcup_nF^{M}_n,\\\\\nU_M&:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_M\\},\\\\\nR_{id,M}&:=R_{id}\\cap(U_M^{<\\omega}\\times U_M),\\quad R_{cut,M}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_M^{<\\omega}\\times U_M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R_M:=(R_{id,M}\\cup R_\\otimes\\cup R_{⅋}\\cup R_1\\cup R_\\bot\\cup R_{cut,M})\\cap(U_M^{<\\omega}\\times U_M),\\qquad\\mathsf{MLL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_M,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_M}(R_M)\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":2249,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-multiplicative-linear|df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-396","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic](72-df-multiplicative-linear.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-multiplicative-linear|df-multiplicative-linear — Multiplicative Linear Logic]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-multiplicative-linear]]"},{"id":"7ce9e286b350fbfc","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-multiplicative-linear]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}